{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57222","headline":"谶 十一 · 菩提达摩","name":"谶 十一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"艮地生玄旨，（艮地者，东北也。\n神秀和尚从五祖下传一枝法，在北自爲立宗旨也）通尊媚亦尊。\n（通尊者，谥号大通禅师也。\n媚者，秀也。\n亦尊者，三帝所尊敬，故亦尊也）比肩三九（《天圣广灯录》作「吼」）族，（比肩者，同学也。\n三九族者，十二人也。\n秀大师同学十二人）足下一有分。\n（从秀和尚足下各分宗旨，南北有异）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"菩提达摩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57222.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57222","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}